{"data":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2025-12-07T15:28:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1997689669279207721"],"id":"1997689669279207721","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1007,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"以后走路谁还敢玩手机炒币？ https://t.co/k3jpbVzPiJ","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1997689669279207721"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2025-11-21T12:56:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1991853165424280003"],"id":"1991853165424280003","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":878,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刚刚那一杀，底部已经走出来了","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1991853165424280003"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2025-11-21T10:17:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1991813204910232053"],"id":"1991813204910232053","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":727,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2663是这次ETH底，9成仓啦","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1991813204910232053"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2025-10-21T07:42:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1980540071658025480"],"id":"1980540071658025480","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":517,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你知道吗？选择伴侣，最重要的不是挑一个“对你好”的人，而是选一个“本身就很好”的人。\n\n这话隐藏着人生决策的密码，能帮你躲开“基础概率谬误”，实现终极幸福。\n\n“本身就很好”，指一个人的品性，是“基础概率”； \n\n而一个人专门“对你好”，是基于某个条件的概率。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1980540071658025480"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2025-08-01T13:40:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1951276829613953382"],"id":"1951276829613953382","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":907,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1950886860714090609","type":"quoted"}],"text":"大山总所言即是，Alpha对于大多项目方是没路可以走的选择，据我了解的情况，大多都没收回成本。有幸帮助过几个Alpha项目方，成功流动性退出，感兴趣的项目方可以私信。 https://t.co/GvR5ab0R5l","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1951276829613953382"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2025-07-18T16:04:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946239552911544814"],"id":"1946239552911544814","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":733,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1909435457953546352","type":"quoted"}],"text":"4.8以太坊见底那天，给出的做多ETH、做空BTC是能承载百亿美金的对冲策略，今年最大的Alpha，目前收益率已达70%。今年在香港跟我沟通过的至少4家以上机构在后续加入到这个策略的执行中。 https://t.co/E8JsqyHu8l https://t.co/25N6kdRgJD","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1946239552911544814"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2025-07-18T07:07:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946104617416417471"],"id":"1946104617416417471","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":568,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1920744746076586302","type":"quoted"}],"text":"现在大家应该明白啥叫以太坊以年为周期的趋势反转了，全网ETH第一吹哨人不为过吧 https://t.co/0LsAsINRMJ https://t.co/avKQtzPNoS","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1946104617416417471"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"167816082","created_at":"2025-07-31T11:50:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1950886860714090609"],"id":"1950886860714090609","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":77,"impression_count":52477,"like_count":154,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":41,"retweet_count":18},"text":"基于我们最近上线的至少5个币安alpha的项目的数据，再结合跟做市商的交流，可以得到的结论是： \n\nAlpha上基本是没什么流动性的，所谓的活跃度大都是工资室的号在刷，他们拿到空投的第一时间就卖了，bnb holder们的空投也一样。不用指望通过alpha获得什么新增用户。"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2025-04-08T02:37:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1909435457953546352"],"id":"1909435457953546352","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1298,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1842569274797576643","type":"quoted"}],"text":"去年给的策略是做多比特币和做空以太坊，很多对冲基金都在践行。今年再给个策略，做多ETH，做空BTC，ETH有可能走去年BTC去年的走势。 https://t.co/j33b0pvY2x"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2025-05-09T07:36:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1920744746076586302"],"id":"1920744746076586302","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1030,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"很多人没看懂，这次以太坊的上涨是以年为周期的趋势反转！\n发在某群的原话：去年做多以太的基金爆仓了几十只，今年做空以太的基金也将惨目忍睹。 https://t.co/HYL6Ybgirz"}],"users":[{"id":"928496628570427392","name":"Mcfly","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1642759051338739718/WY7Hugml_normal.jpg","username":"Mcfly2140","verified":false},{"id":"167816082","name":"Jademont","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1568576804516134913/_mjuRDPm_normal.jpg","username":"shanshan521","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1997689669279207721","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3fsc886c6m8d49om2cg54j8umv87m9p","oldest_id":"1946104617416417471","result_count":7}}